== what was explored (not yet implemented) ==

### harmonic address space insights
- AMOS checksum tree addresses as rays: each input is a trajectory through
  7-level space. character ray table in entropy-at-deduplication-root.md.
- parallel hyperspace deduplication: 7 offset dimensions × 7 lengths ×
  N template namespaces, each an independent valid-address space
- distributed ring inversion: local directory overhead = global ring
  bandwidth. log₃₂(N) depth grows with network, capacity superlinear
- 2D bit matrix representations: checksumming glyphs/symbols directly
  bypasses all linguistic encoding, universal content ID
- formation antennas: node clusters as phased arrays, directional trunks,
  portal services between distant harmonic regions

