== key technical notes ==

- MCP task dispatch: description field IS the prompt, no 'kimi-task -file'
  prefix needed. context field for additional background.
- index.gen_path: uses modes 5,7 across offsets 0-6, truth filter 7,9,
  reseeds if below minimum subdir count (4). core path generation done.
- harmonic.coords: uses length 7-offset (7,6,5 for X,Y,Z), not all 7.
  internally consistent, axis agreement detection works correctly.
- template-resolver.resolve: guard `ref $params eq 'HASH'` required for
  any module called both directly and as a timer handler
- p7refToCoords decodes ADDR_B32: standard RFC4648 base32, chars A-Z2-7
  bytes: [theta/255*2pi, phi/255*pi, psi/255*pi, omega/255*2pi, 4-byte time]

